# 2026-10-21

## [A static page, a real Zig generator](/blog/static-zig-playground/)

Zine builds the pages from SuperMD. Zig and zast build a Wasm generator. The browser joins
them together to turn editable JSON into formatted Zig, with no generation
service in the request path.

Read the architecture note for the build steps, memory boundary, and current
scope of the example.
